operation app.start | Start the Unravis app with no window (a headless owner) and wait until it answers.
operation app.status | Say whether the Unravis app runs, who owns it and which protocol it speaks.
operation app.stop | Stop the headless Unravis app and wait until it is gone.
operation audit.activity | Live query.
operation audit.breakdown | Live query.
operation audit.compare | Live query.
operation audit.groups | Cached, no query.
operation audit.guide | Cached, no query.
operation audit.requests | Live query.
operation audit.slowest | Live query.
operation audit.timeline | Cached, no query.
operation audit.timelines.compare | Cached, no query.
operation blackbox.inspect | Read a Blackbox recording folder or hourly file from disk, with no running app, and say what it holds.
operation cases.list | List the cases of the running app, as its window lists them: id, title, dates, size and flags, plus erase n...
operation cases.show | Show one case: the fields of the list plus the counts of environments and sources and the history (kind and...
operation doctor | Check this command line and its link to the running app: its version and place, the app program, and whethe...
operation schema | List the operations, or describe one: its input, output and errors.
operation sources.list | Cached, no query.
operation version | Print the version of the command line and the protocol it speaks.
